# =============================================================================
# NOTES AND TIPS
# =============================================================================

# Configuration Tips:
# 1. Use absolute paths for production deployments
# 2. Enable authentication for production environments  
# 3. Adjust monitoring thresholds based on your hardware
# 4. Use JSON logging for production log aggregation
# 5. Monitor disk space if using file logging
# 6. Set appropriate cache TTL based on your use case
# 7. Configure CORS origins for dashboard access

